      "writtenOn": "2022-11-29T02:30:54Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Rust newbie\u0027s question back: ? seems to exit the current function (i.e. `run_vm`) immediately and propagate the error outside of the code block. Would you prefer to do so for invalid pvmfw path string? If so, then I\u0027d like to add logging.",
